{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"一、七年，春王正月，鼷鼠食郊牛角。改卜牛，鼷鼠又食其角，乃免牛。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"二、吳伐郯。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"三、夏五月，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"四、不郊，猶三望。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"五、秋，楚公子嬰齊率師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"六、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、〈木巳〉伯救鄭。八月戊辰，同盟于馬陵。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"七、吳入州來。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"八、冬，大雩。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_139_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_139","textTraditional":"九、衞孫林父出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}